Subject: Default APP_PATH to the package install root
Origin: DHI-internal (install layout)
Description: Point the operator launcher at /usr/share/stackgres-operator.
 Upstream's launcher defaults APP_PATH to /app, the directory its image copies
 the Quarkus application into. The package installs the application under
 /usr/share/stackgres-operator, so the default follows it. Setting APP_PATH
 still overrides it.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/ongres/stackgres.git 003e92b0be1aaaeb91b05f07c90ade9d7ce65814
Verify: test tests/stackgres_operator_test.go::TestStackGresOperatorDEB
Forwarded: not-needed (upstream's image always installs the application under /app)
Drop-When: never: the package installs the application outside /app

--- a/stackgres-k8s/src/operator/src/main/docker/stackgres-operator.jvm.sh
+++ b/stackgres-k8s/src/operator/src/main/docker/stackgres-operator.jvm.sh
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 #!/bin/sh
 
-APP_PATH="${APP_PATH:-/app}"
+APP_PATH="${APP_PATH:-/usr/share/stackgres-operator}"
 if [ "$DEBUG_OPERATOR" = true ]
 then
   set -x
